---
title: Knowledge-Hub — Microservice Communication Patterns
---
graph LR
    subgraph SYNC["🔄 Synchronous Communication (REST/GraphQL)"]
        direction TB
        GW2["API Gateway"] -->|REST| US2["User Service"]
        GW2 -->|REST| AS2["Article Service"]
        GW2 -->|GraphQL| CS2["Category Service"]
        GW2 -->|GraphQL| SS2["Search Service"]
        AS2 -->|REST - Get Author| US2
        CS2 -->|REST - Get Articles| AS2
        SS2 -->|REST - Get Article Details| AS2
    end

    subgraph ASYNC["📨 Asynchronous Communication (Kafka Events)"]
        direction TB
        AS3["Article Service"] -->|ArticleCreated<br/>ArticleUpdated<br/>ArticleDeleted| K1["article-events<br/>Topic"]
        US3["User Service"] -->|UserCreated<br/>UserUpdated<br/>UserDeactivated| K2["user-events<br/>Topic"]
        COLLAB3["Collaboration<br/>Service"] -->|CommentAdded<br/>ReviewSubmitted| K3["collaboration-events<br/>Topic"]

        K1 -->|Index Article| SS3["Search Service"]
        K1 -->|Update Stats| ANS3["Analytics Service"]
        K1 -->|Auto-Summarize<br/>Auto-Tag| AIS3["AI/LLM Service"]
        K1 -->|Notify Author| NS3["Notification Service"]

        K2 -->|Welcome Email| NS3
        K2 -->|Update Search Index| SS3

        K3 -->|Notify Article Author| NS3
        K3 -->|Update Activity Stats| ANS3
    end

    subgraph CACHE["⚡ Caching Pattern (Redis)"]
        direction TB
        SVC["Any Service"] -->|1. Check Cache| RED["Redis Cache"]
        RED -->|2a. Cache HIT| SVC
        SVC -->|2b. Cache MISS → Query DB| DB["PostgreSQL"]
        DB -->|3. Return Data| SVC
        SVC -->|4. Store in Cache| RED
    end

    style SYNC fill:#E3F2FD,stroke:#1565C0
    style ASYNC fill:#FFF8E1,stroke:#F9A825
    style CACHE fill:#FCE4EC,stroke:#C62828
